# Playback regression job for the r1 speaker (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.play; boot-arg mtkaudio=2): a raw tone straight to
# /dev/redwood-audio, then one through iOS. Compare the kernel's "redwood-audio: ... sound, peak" and "mtkaudio: played:" lines.
/redwood/bin/sound_test springboard wait 3 raw 3 wait 2 tone 2 wait 3
